        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;How duplicates are handled&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Every event is inserted into staging as it arrives, even repeats. No unique rule here, so nothing is lost on arrival.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. A promotion job reads &lt;i&gt;pending&lt;/i&gt; rows, oldest first.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;3. sale_uid not in &lt;b&gt;sale&lt;/b&gt; yet: insert sale + items in one DB transaction, status = &lt;i&gt;promoted&lt;/i&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;4. sale_uid already promoted, same payload_hash: status = &lt;i&gt;duplicate&lt;/i&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;5. Same sale_uid, different payload_hash: status = &lt;i&gt;rejected&lt;/i&gt; (conflicting data, needs a look).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;store_code is looked up in &lt;b&gt;store&lt;/b&gt; during promotion; an unknown store is &lt;i&gt;rejected&lt;/i&gt;." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=14;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="900" y="116" width="350" height="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Keys&lt;/b&gt;: PK primary key · FK foreign key · UQ unique · IX indexed, repeats allowed · CK format checked&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;CK checks&lt;/b&gt;: currency = 3 capital letters (USD) · state = 2 capital letters (UT) · payload_hash = 64 hex characters&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Money&lt;/b&gt; is stored as integer cents ($19.99 = 1999).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Times&lt;/b&gt; are TIMESTAMPTZ, saved in UTC.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;status&lt;/b&gt;: pending, promoted, duplicate, rejected" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BBBBBB;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="900" y="462" width="350" height="176" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
